Submit a billable AI Toolkit training job, typically LoRA training.

Backs POST /prod/v1/trainers/ai-toolkit/jobs. The job mounts a READY dataset
and runs config_file, a complete AI Toolkit YAML string. training_folder must
be /app/ai-toolkit/output; dataset folder_path must be
/app/ai-toolkit/datasets/{dataset_name}, using the dataset's name rather than ID.
gpu_type is ADA_80_PLUS (H100) or HOPPER_141 (H200). gpu_count is 1 by default
or 8 for multi-GPU on ADA_80_PLUS only. gpu_id is an optional selector such as
"#1". Training can take hours; submission returns when the job is queued and
consumes RunComfy balance as compute runs.

